{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "cache-in-front",
  "title": "A cache in front of the database",
  "summary": "A database on a slow disk limits the whole system. See how much a cache helps, and how quickly that help depends on its hit ratio.",
  "level": "beginner",
  "minutes": 4,
  "project": {
    "name": "A cache in front of the database",
    "serverProfile": {
      "os": "linux",
      "cpuCores": 4,
      "cpuGhz": 3.0,
      "ramGb": 16.0,
      "disk": {
        "kind": "ssd",
        "iops": 20000
      },
      "network": {
        "bandwidthMbps": 1000.0,
        "latencyMs": 0.5
      },
      "virtualization": "vm",
      "fdLimit": 65536
    },
    "trafficProfile": {
      "concurrentUsers": 1000,
      "requestsPerSecond": 500.0,
      "readRatio": 0.8,
      "spike": {
        "kind": "none"
      }
    },
    "topology": {
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "client",
          "kind": "client",
          "label": "Users",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 120
          },
          "template": null,
          "settings": {},
          "replicas": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "app",
          "kind": "appServer",
          "label": "App servers",
          "position": {
            "x": 260,
            "y": 120
          },
          "template": null,
          "settings": {},
          "replicas": 4
        },
        {
          "id": "db",
          "kind": "database",
          "label": "Database",
          "position": {
            "x": 520,
            "y": 120
          },
          "template": null,
          "settings": {},
          "replicas": 1
        }
      ],
      "edges": [
        {
          "id": "e-client-app",
          "source": "client",
          "target": "app"
        },
        {
          "id": "e-app-db",
          "source": "app",
          "target": "db"
        }
      ]
    },
    "chaos": {
      "faults": [],
      "policy": {
        "timeoutMs": 10000.0,
        "maxRetries": 0,
        "backoffMs": 100.0
      }
    },
    "slo": {
      "p95Ms": 200.0,
      "maxErrorRate": 0.01
    }
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "title": "Four app servers, one database",
      "narration": [
        "A common shape: several app servers share one database. At 500 requests per second the app servers are comfortable and the database is about half busy.",
        "Every request that is not answered earlier ends up at the database, and there is only one of it."
      ],
      "highlight": ["db"],
      "changes": [],
      "play": {
        "mode": "live",
        "durationS": 30.0,
        "speed": 5
      },
      "expect": [
        {
          "kind": "meetsTargets",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "bottleneck",
          "node": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "utilizationBelow",
          "node": "db",
          "value": 0.7
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Traffic nearly doubles",
      "narration": [
        "Traffic grows to 900 requests per second. The app servers still have plenty of room, but the database cannot keep up.",
        "Adding more app servers would not help: the slowest shared part sets the pace for everything."
      ],
      "highlight": ["db"],
      "changes": [
        {
          "kind": "apply",
          "change": {
            "kind": "trafficRate",
            "rps": 900.0
          }
        }
      ],
      "play": {
        "mode": "live",
        "durationS": 30.0,
        "speed": 5
      },
      "expect": [
        {
          "kind": "meetsTargets",
          "value": false
        },
        {
          "kind": "bottleneck",
          "node": "db"
        },
        {
          "kind": "utilizationBelow",
          "node": "app",
          "value": 0.7
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Put a cache in front",
      "narration": [
        "Add a cache. A read that finds its answer there never touches the database. Writes still go straight to it.",
        "With four out of five reads answered by the cache, the database sees a fraction of the traffic and the system is healthy again."
      ],
      "highlight": ["cache", "db"],
      "changes": [],
      "play": {
        "mode": "live",
        "durationS": 30.0,
        "speed": 5
      },
      "expect": [
        {
          "kind": "meetsTargets",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "bottleneck",
          "node": null
        }
      ],
      "topology": {
        "nodes": [
          {
            "id": "client",
            "kind": "client",
            "label": "Users",
            "position": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 150
            },
            "template": null,
            "settings": {},
            "replicas": 1
          },
          {
            "id": "app",
            "kind": "appServer",
            "label": "App servers",
            "position": {
              "x": 260,
              "y": 150
            },
            "template": null,
            "settings": {},
            "replicas": 4
          },
          {
            "id": "cache",
            "kind": "cache",
            "label": "Cache",
            "position": {
              "x": 560,
              "y": 0
            },
            "template": {
              "id": "redis",
              "version": 2
            },
            "settings": {},
            "replicas": 1
          },
          {
            "id": "db",
            "kind": "database",
            "label": "Database",
            "position": {
              "x": 560,
              "y": 300
            },
            "template": null,
            "settings": {},
            "replicas": 1
          }
        ],
        "edges": [
          {
            "id": "e-client-app",
            "source": "client",
            "target": "app"
          },
          {
            "id": "e-app-cache",
            "source": "app",
            "target": "cache"
          },
          {
            "id": "e-app-db",
            "source": "app",
            "target": "db"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "The hit ratio drops",
      "narration": [
        "A cache is only as good as the share of requests it can answer. If the hit ratio falls to 20 percent, say after a deploy that changes the keys, most reads fall through to the database again.",
        "Same cache, same traffic, and the database is overloaded once more."
      ],
      "highlight": ["cache", "db"],
      "changes": [
        {
          "kind": "apply",
          "change": {
            "kind": "nodeSetting",
            "node": "cache",
            "key": "hit_ratio",
            "value": 0.2
          }
        }
      ],
      "play": {
        "mode": "live",
        "durationS": 30.0,
        "speed": 5
      },
      "expect": [
        {
          "kind": "meetsTargets",
          "value": false
        },
        {
          "kind": "bottleneck",
          "node": "db"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Give the cache more room",
      "narration": [
        "Give the cache more memory and a better eviction policy so that 95 percent of reads are hits. The database is now less busy than it was at 500 requests per second, even though traffic is nearly double.",
        "What is left is mostly writes, which a cache cannot absorb. Caching works by making the slow path rare, so the hit ratio is the number to watch."
      ],
      "highlight": ["cache"],
      "changes": [
        {
          "kind": "apply",
          "change": {
            "kind": "nodeSetting",
            "node": "cache",
            "key": "hit_ratio",
            "value": 0.95
          }
        }
      ],
      "play": {
        "mode": "live",
        "durationS": 30.0,
        "speed": 5
      },
      "expect": [
        {
          "kind": "meetsTargets",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "utilizationBelow",
          "node": "db",
          "value": 0.65
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
